  "title": "Nourishing Thai Chicken Wrap",
  "description": "A light and herbal Thai-inspired dish featuring Thai sweet basil and wok-hei flavors, wrapped in a lotus leaf for a low-carb friendly meal.",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
