  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add chicken to the pot and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and ginger to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add Thai sweet basil, fish sauce, and lime juice to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Warm lotus leaves by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wraps by spooning the chicken mixture onto a lotus leaf and serving immediately."
  ],
